  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Desk for Human Rights in Africa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helpdesk M&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Afrika</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett st&#xf6;djande bidrag f&#xf6;r att underl&#xe4;tta ambassader i Afrika som beh&#xf6;ver kortsiktigt och flexibelt st&#xf6;d p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. b. Denna insats &#xe4;r relaterad till: HelpDesken &#xe4;r avsp&#xe4;rrad fr&#xe5;n Sidas ramavtal f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter som fanns fram till slutet av 2014. Help Desk kommer att tillhandah&#xe5;lla kortvariga skrivbordsuppdrag, i vissa fall med f&#xe4;ltresor, i h&#xf6;gst 10 dagar, med fokus p&#xe5; &#xe4;mnesomr&#xe5;dena f&#xf6;r:
 &#x2022; System och f&#xf6;rsvarare f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter 
&#x2022; M&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsbaserad strategi (inkl. icke-diskriminering) 
&#x2022; Yttrandefrihet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a supportive contribution, to facilitate Embassies in Africa who need short-term and flexible support in the area of human rights. b. This intervention is related to: The Help Desk is called off from Sida&apos;s Framework Agreement for Human Rights in existence up to the end of 2014. The Help Desk will provide short-term desk assignments, in some cases involving field trips, for a maximum of 10 days, focusing on the subject areas of:
 &#x2022; Human Rights systems &amp; defenders 
&#x2022; Human Rights Based Approach (incl. Non&#xac;Discrimination) 
&#x2022; Freedom of Expression</narrative>
  </description>
